Z||000000||FOCOSEVA||08-01-2001||03:09 PM||||If you are trailering your Fiero to the Festival, be aware that there will be no room for trailers on the car show field. If your Fiero is driveable, please unload it at the Ramada Inn (or your hotel if otherwise) and drive it to the car show. No trailers will be allowed on the car show field. 200+ Fieros are coming. If your trailered Fiero is not driveable (not running, not street legal, etc.), please wait until the rest of the Fieros are staged on the car show field, and then unload your Fiero on the access road. There will be volunteer traffic directors to show everyone where to go. Everyone, please try not to tie up traffic. There will be plenty of time to get everyone staged on the car show field. Dragsters: Please no burnouts or wheelies! Thank you all for your consideration. If you have any questions, please call me before Thursday morning. My number is (804) 693-4650. See you there! Curry Obenshain||||reg||4
